  "scenario_text": "name walk_hillside\ndescribe Walk up and then back down a steep slope. Asserts no ground violations and -- once Prompt 003's step-jitter metric exists -- that the smoothed eye does not visibly stair-step. The svo world is 7.8 mm voxels, so every slope is a sub-centimetre staircase and this is the pose where the smoothing budget either works or does not.\nbackend both\noption --walk\npose_ground 0,16 -90 -10 1.7\nhold forward 8\nhold none 1\nlook 90 -8 1\nhold forward 8\nwait 3\ncapture event grounded on_ground\ncapture end final\nassert walk_violations == 0\nassert contrast_percent > 6\n",
